    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/1f7461c58ee7d9cf81340acbb38689d3.poster.avif?t=1754640169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/1f7461c58ee7d9cf81340acbb38689d3.webm?t=1754640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/1f7461c58ee7d9cf81340acbb38689d3.mp4?t=1754640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure to retrieve lost memory and delve into the world's mysteries. Fight against the evil legion alongside your allies encountered on the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is separated into two parts (part 1 and part 2). Part 2 is still currently in development. This product (&quot;Soul Dier - Part 1&quot;) only includes part 1 and does not include part 2.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic JRPG style grid-based and turn-based tactical battles.\u00a0Every turn you can use your movement, attack, skills, items or wait actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/4977d8ed4764800b396ebb798d0d538e.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emphasis on positioning with covers and directional defense.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/8bfec5b8d0c485f19d6d975743a85802.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 hand-crafted levels and estimated 15 - 20 hours of playtime (part 1).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide variety of unique scenes, enemies and character skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/3dab7f55a710c4ae0b10f31b6624ad94.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging gameplay that requires strategic and cautious moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mysterious world through\u00a0cutscenes in every level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/ca6e91f623a217bb474ddfc47e5c349f.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lightweight progression system without any grinding.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your style of battle\u00a0with charms, items and character upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/2da4cf976fc3abe39d055a9e0416fd2b.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ original sound tracks (part 1).</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/1f7461c58ee7d9cf81340acbb38689d3.poster.avif?t=1754640169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/1f7461c58ee7d9cf81340acbb38689d3.webm?t=1754640169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/1f7461c58ee7d9cf81340acbb38689d3.mp4?t=1754640169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure to retrieve lost memory and delve into the world's mysteries. Fight against the evil legion alongside your allies encountered on the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is separated into two parts (part 1 and part 2). Part 2 is still currently in development. This product (&quot;Soul Dier - Part 1&quot;) only includes part 1 and does not include part 2.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic JRPG style grid-based and turn-based tactical battles.\u00a0Every turn you can use your movement, attack, skills, items or wait actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/4977d8ed4764800b396ebb798d0d538e.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emphasis on positioning with covers and directional defense.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/8bfec5b8d0c485f19d6d975743a85802.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 hand-crafted levels and estimated 15 - 20 hours of playtime (part 1).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide variety of unique scenes, enemies and character skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/3dab7f55a710c4ae0b10f31b6624ad94.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging gameplay that requires strategic and cautious moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mysterious world through\u00a0cutscenes in every level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/ca6e91f623a217bb474ddfc47e5c349f.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lightweight progression system without any grinding.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your style of battle\u00a0with charms, items and character upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134980/extras/2da4cf976fc3abe39d055a9e0416fd2b.avif?t=1754640169\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ original sound tracks (part 1).</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Soul Dier is a story-driven turn-based tactical JRPG. Non-repetitive hand-crafted levels with vastly different themes. Challenging but fair gameplay with unique level mechanics. Simple progression system with 0 grinding. All animated cutscenes to explore a mysterious world with vivid characters.",
